WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.794
The CRAFTED comparison begins with the cost of one changed query.

00:00:01.794 --> 00:00:02.854
Open the query prefix selector.

00:00:02.854 --> 00:00:04.469
Inspect the first eight queries.

00:00:04.469 --> 00:00:06.985
Select the complete 64-query stream.

00:00:06.985 --> 00:00:09.174
Switch from the simulated CRAFTED pool to the NIST relation.

00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:11.220
Inspect the far stream.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.048
Set k to 50. Transport wins one paired block out of three.
